      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: DM'd you the specifics as well as the logs. I'll repaste them here for others.\nWhen does this happen?\nCan't say for sure, when it occurs seems to be inconsistent. Sometimes it works for some and for others it doesn't. I did notice for one person where it was broken, when I restarted the client, it fixed their icon.\nIs it only when you're not in the same world?\nSeems to happen no matter what. Tried going to the same worlds as people that were affected and it still occurred for them. Also shows that even swapping worlds didn't fix it.\nOnly when they're in a private world?\nHappened regardless of whether or not they were in a private world.\nI'm also quickly editing a video to showcase a bit of the bug.\nVideo: https://files.catbox.moe/g1x1ge.mp4",
